===Etymology===
Equivalent to {{m|ru|черный|черно-|t=[[black]]}} + {{m|sla-pro|*bylь|t=[[herb]]|}}, see {{m|ru|былинка|t=[[blade]] of [[grass]]}} for the second element. 
{{catlangname|ru|terms derived from Proto-Slavic}}

Compare {{cog|uk|чорно́биль}}, {{cog|cs|černobýl}}.

